<title>USA: GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM STANDINGS.</title>
<headline>GOLF-U.S. RYDER CUP TEAM STANDINGS.</headline>
<dateline>PALM BEACH GARDENS, Florida 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standings</p>
<p>for the U.S. Ryder Cup team (top 10 players automatically</p>
<p>qualify for the matches against Europe at Valderrama in</p>
<p>Sotogrande, Spain from September 26-28):</p>
<p>  1. Tom Lehman			    696.290 points</p>
<p>  2. Mark O'Meara			  570.000</p>
<p>  3. Davis Love III			525.000</p>
<p>  4. Mark Brooks			   519.750</p>
<p>  5. Phil Mickelson			501.790</p>
<p>  6. Steve Jones			   489.280</p>
<p>  7. Tiger Woods			   485.000</p>
<p>  8. Scott Hoch			    404.280</p>
<p>  9. Kenny Perry			   371.250</p>
<p> 10. Fred Couples			  351.790</p>
<p> 11. Steve Stricker			342.500</p>
<p> 12. John Cook			     341.000</p>
<p> 13. Tommy Tolles			  334.280</p>
<p> 14. David Duval			   320.000</p>
<p> 15. Mark Calcavecchia		   305.000</p>
